","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-26T10:31:13Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T10:38:08Z","body":"Looking closer at the code it does seem like this header is not available in some cases due to changes in the upstream library removing the include, not sure why it doesn't show up in some cases, but is a simple fix to add these includes where needed to avoid fragile dependencies\n\nThe files affected would be:\n* `modules/svg/image_loader_svg.cpp`\n* `modules/text_server_adv/thorvg_svg_in_ot.cpp`\n* `modules/text_server_fb/thorvg_svg_in_ot.cpp`\n\nThe simple fix would be to add the include in those three files, unsure what specifically triggers this might be differences in the internal includes for the compiler\n\nProbably an edge case from:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116024\n\nMight be better to change the use of `unique_ptr` in these cases CC @Chubercik \n\nSo not necessarily a simple fix will see what the response is for that","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5083091324/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]